{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "beb0ee4c-413b-807a-92b5-5cd9c5cf50de",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:25:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:22:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:22:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, this is Judith Burdick. I got a reminder notice in the mail today for a water and sewer bill, and I never got the actual bill. Never saw it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the account number on the reminder, or the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:22:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, it has the account number, hang on. Let me get my glasses. Oh, and the thing is, it went to my old address. I moved over a year ago, so, I mean, how would I have seen it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Read me the account number whenever you're ready, and I'll pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four, four, one, seven, dash, zero, nine. That's all it shows, I think. [pause] Yes, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:23:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have it here. The mailing address on file is the previous one, you're right. So the bill was sent there, and the reminder was the first notice that reached you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:23:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what I said. Nobody changed it, and now I'm being, you know, reminded about something I never got."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can update the mailing address right now if you give me the current one. Then future bills will come to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yes, please. It's the same one the reminder came to, actually. The reminder found me somehow. So use that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:23:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, I'll make sure it's set as the mailing address. Anything else on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, can I do a payment plan? Because it's more than I'd like to pay all at once, and I'd rather not, you know, [inaudible] in one lump."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:24:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Payment arrangements are sometimes possible. I'll note your request and have the billing supervisor call you back to go over options. Is this the best number, ending 0197?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one, 401-555-0197. And also, I can't get to City Hall before four-thirty, I'm not able to get down there in time. Can I pay it online? Or some other way when you're closed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's an online payment option on the city website, and there's also a drop box outside City Hall for checks. Just put your account number on the check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:24:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. A drop box. Fine. I'll probably wait until the supervisor calls, though. [pause] I'm sorry, I'm a little distracted, I'm just craving a maple glazed doughnut something terrible, and it's lunchtime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, hopefully you can get one after this. I've noted the address update and the callback request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, dear. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:25:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye, Ms. Burdick."
    }
  ],
